OL,3,ANvidia stocks plummet in US after CEO
OL,4,AJensen Huang quits in wake of affair
OL,5,Awith suspected Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays, with chief financial officer
OL,10,FColette Kress appointed interim boss
OL,12,FThe company's shares plummeted more
OL,13,Fthan 13% as US markets opened shortly
OL,14,Fafter news of Huang's resignation
OL,16,FIt comes after the New York Times
OL,17,Freported that he had a second affair
OL,18,Fwith an executive at his own company
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
